    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d691">

                <pb facs="0808" n="798" sameAs="frus:frus1948v08/pg798"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.9327/6–1748: Airgram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Stuart</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1948-06-17">June 17, 1948</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>A–129. Connection consultation air transport agreement, suggest Emb attempt
                    elimination or, if that is impossible, modification of art 3 agreement. Present
                    wording appears to be in error in that it is multilateral language derived from
                    Chicago standard form.<anchor n="29" xml:id="d691-f1"/> Suggest Emb review files
                    concerning negotiations, particularly Deptel 732 Sep 9, 1946.<anchor n="30"
                        xml:id="d691-f2"/></p>
                <p>Copy this airgram being sent Shanghai.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Marshall</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
